  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two conductors have the same resistances at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> but their temperature coefficients of resistance are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The respective temperature coefficients for their series and parallel combinations are :</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo> </mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
